<!-- Akan face templates.

     The engine builds a random face by interpolating each parameter between
     BodyPropertiesMin and BodyPropertiesMax. The previous version of this file
     used the SAME key for min and max, which left zero range to randomise
     within - that is why every Akan in the game had an identical face.

     The min/max keys below are the per-parameter bounding box of five hand-made
     Akan faces (Cudjoe, Zea, Joejoe, Nyla and the original fighter key). Every
     key keeps the 003F...CC prefix those five share, so the complexion stays
     put while the facial features vary. Do not widen these toward the native
     aserai ranges - that prefix is what holds the skin tone. -->
